INSERT INTO red_pill_verses (verse_id, claim_class, class_label, card_title, card_md, anchor_refs, tier_required, last_reviewed_at)
VALUES ((SELECT v.id FROM verses v JOIN chapters c ON c.id = v.chapter_id JOIN books b ON b.id = c.book_id JOIN editions e ON e.id = b.edition_id WHERE e.slug = 'canon' AND b.slug = 'revelation' AND c.chapter_number = 1 AND v.verse_number = 8), 'direct', 'His own mouth', 'Alpha and Omega — which is, and which was, and which is to come', $card$*Behold, he cometh with clouds; and every eye shall see him, and they also which pierced him: and all kindreds of the earth shall wail because of him. Even so, Amen. I am Alpha and Omega, the beginning and the ending, saith Yahuah (Lord), which is, and which was, and which is to come, the Almighty.* (Revelation 1:7-8)

*Who hath wrought and done it, calling the generations from the beginning? I Yahuah (LORD), the first, and with the last; I am he.* (Isaiah 41:4)

The speaker of verse 8 is the one verse 7 says is coming with clouds — the pierced one. He names himself with Yahuah (God)'s own self-description from the prophets: the first, with the last, *I am he.* The Almighty's name in the mouth of the one who was pierced.$card$, '{"Isaiah 41:4","Revelation 1:7"}'::TEXT[], 'free', NOW())
